{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"be4eaced8b37613f11b25b9b86f9a1dc3bf0f583746a5ecd338b09ee5287bc62","ja":"帰省って、どんな感じ？","zh":"回老家，是什么感觉？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ed23c75c28bf6c516a61aa52870ee2afd2aa2d4483ce0834e186df09daedb7e1","ja":"ふむふむ……紬ちゃんは、もともと\n短めの帰省予定だったんですね！　知りませんでした！","zh":"嗯嗯……原来紬本来就计划短暂回趟老家啊！我都不知道！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"58d519c884f3f5624343cb1fbc4548ea8f6c5c3f25954ac6db14713d9fc34982","ja":"はい、年始に仕事も控えておりましたから……。\nできれば劇場でレッスンができればと。","zh":"是的，因为年初还有工作等着我……所以如果可以的话，我想在剧场进行练习。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bc3eb47820f569f33cdc20a74c4805c942fe387c813faa38787b16e21b41ff3f","ja":"おふたりは……帰省がどんなものか知りたくて、\n誰かが帰ってくるのを待っていらっしゃったんですね。","zh":"原来两位……是想知道回老家是什么样的，所以一直在等有人回来啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f0a6cdbb8bbc977152daee98f7926ced1e9eda94ffad1a2bf8b196cd7b958be9","ja":"そうなんですよ～。ねぇねぇ、久しぶりの実家って\nどんな感じでした？　家族と会えて感動！とか？　","zh":"就是这样嘛～。对了对了，久违地回老家，感觉怎么样？见到家人后感动得热泪盈眶之类的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3925f5d39463ac36db45124687e0b5a2b0f8ba3855640118a703d32880820fad","ja":"ええと……そこまでドラマティックではないかと。\n年に何度かは帰っていますから。","zh":"呃……我觉得还没那么戏剧性十足。\n毕竟一年里也会回去几次。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"25408de47cbea9d068003634740b5082bbb4d5379bf073e53c62f4054b7f137d","ja":"さすが紬ちゃん！　成長したお姿を\nこまめにご家族にお見せしに行ってるんですね！","zh":"不愧是紬！一直都有抽空去给家人看看自己成长后的样子呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b105bf1bdcfda1a959ca45a2a69b0f2a0757dade5ac5ece41b8c604fa509b581","ja":"そ、そこまで大げさなものでもないというか……。\nもっと気軽なものです。","zh":"也、也没那么夸张……  \n其实是更轻松的东西。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6e8be53e29acfba9aa1ac85343a192a7f50fb8d20cc1e99532bab069bc6d9f40","ja":"いつもと違うことがあるといえば……団らん時間が\n長いのと食べ物が贅沢、ということでしょうか。","zh":"要说和往常不同的地方……就是相聚闲谈的时间更长，吃的东西也更丰盛吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2a38fbb3b12e954560b006abc6c7240f090ee47f960c2d7dee0b289f3138c997","ja":"あ！　帰省すると、みんなで\nすき焼きとかお寿司とか食べるんですよね！？","zh":"啊！回老家的时候，大家会一起吃寿喜烧或者寿司之类的，对吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"94709b0889e94ad9872ed817f2a2f09d07a032393bbc8f67bf0cbe205742007b","ja":"はい。他にも、旬を迎えた蟹やタラも……。\n実は、みなさんへのお土産にもしたんですよ。","zh":"是的。另外还有正值当季的螃蟹和鳕鱼……其实也给大家准备了伴手礼。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b0168749eb44d0c831eccebe1468114091c740c0133ef9ced8f620232a0c8e7d","ja":"えへへ。実は、その大っきな箱ずっと気になって\nたんですー。やっぱり美味しいものだったんですね♪","zh":"嘿嘿。其实，我一直很在意那个大箱子——原来里面果然是好吃的东西呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"22a7630055a0ecf035e956ef0a0c3eaaf58ccfc514b28ee4f5aa624a59b985fc","ja":"はい。蟹は鍋を用意しないといけないので……\nまずはお菓子を食べませんか？　金沢銘菓です。","zh":"是的。吃螃蟹得先准备火锅，所以……  \n要不要先吃点心？这是金泽的名点。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ef3c2ab49f3051d57964cc550f68a3ef381448f6e2c189951365e403467abb7f","ja":"あっ、梅の形してる！　カワイイ～！　こういう\n地元ならではのお菓子があるのも羨ましいな～。","zh":"啊，做成梅子的形状了！好可爱～！能有这种只有当地才有的点心，也真让人羡慕呀～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8fa4f42d8f9b551f94192e1ed971ae9f0b3be3f93e2467f6c1b45577f09aeb4d","ja":"喜んでもらえて嬉しいです。あの……おふたりは\nご近所におすすめのお店など、ありますか？","zh":"你们能喜欢，我很高兴。那个……两位知道附近有什么推荐的店吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5381a60defaf904079a57d89e5368dca5e2f45432ca4999dc3c6763f621e149d","ja":"はい！　最近、家の近くに美味しい\nパン屋さんができたんです！　塩バターが人気ですよ！","zh":"是的！最近我家附近开了一家面包店！盐黄油面包很受欢迎哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7254553931cc10e3b9f6c8a9c52702c59d9cbf2ed2b16b9af6913e0a71d4da27","ja":"今度一緒にどうですか？　そ、そして、\nよければありさのおうちにぜひぜひ！","zh":"下次要不要一起？　还、还有，如果您愿意的话，请务必来亚利沙家里！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a9a4193c2a1ef3922b07862b8734ab2cb511d80938b5fe4e74ebe3e14d0a60b0","ja":"はい。松田さんのお部屋、とても気になります。\n色々なアイドルのグッズがありそうで。","zh":"是的。我很想看看松田小姐的房间。感觉里面好像会有各种各样偶像的周边。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"84b8c6bdd4e3002944e70830729c845eaf4340a3aa808d677425da18976afa54","ja":"……私、実はこういう何気ないことで\nみなさんが羨ましくなることがあるんです。","zh":"……其实，我有时会因为这种不经意的小事而羡慕大家。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"f06bfd7db2a5474321d41bbb252834a18b11525748e8a47229a49adf1c835dd8","ja":"えっ、そうなんですか……？","zh":"咦，是这样吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
